5,1,1,talk,May,,Hi everyone! Let's get this sorted so we can stop complaining and start relaxing. I want to make sure whatever we decide is actually fair for everyone involved. Shall we dive in?,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Let's be efficient. To make a fair decision, we need a clear picture of the current problems and what's actually possible. I suggest we start by examining the facts before proposing solutions.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm in! Let's make this a great spot for everyone. I think we should check the money side of things first so we know what we can actually afford. What do you guys think?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Kenji. It's important to be mindful of the costs. I also hope we can find a solution that makes everyone feel comfortable and happy living side by side. Let's be considerate of each other.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to see such spirit. Let us move forward with kindness and patience. To ensure our solution is sustainable for the soul and the schedule, I believe we need a comprehensive view.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm with you, Mizuki. Facts first! I'm curious about the ""Ward complaint log for this point"" and the ""Measurements of the five frontages."" Let's see who's actually bothered and how much space we're dealing with.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"That's a practical start, May. I'll look into the ""Supervised mornings on the next lane"" and the ""Visit to the station block's bin house"" to see how other areas manage their daily operations.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll take the ""Block ledger of refuse-point expenses"" and ""Ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs""! I want to see exactly how much we've been spending and if the ward helps us out.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'll look into the ""Statements at the residents' meeting"" and the ""Ward complaint log for this point."" I want to understand the history of our disagreements so we can move forward in harmony.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall look into the ""Truck arrival time from the crew leader"" and the ""Ward filing requirements per the installations clerk."" Understanding the rhythm of the work and the rules will help us avoid undue burdens.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"Sounds like we've got all our bases covered! I'm especially interested to see if the space measurements reveal any imbalances. @Midori, let me know if the complaint log shows any specific patterns!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, patterns are key. If we understand the root of the complaints and the reality of neighboring setups, we can avoid a superficial fix that just creates new problems. Let's see what the data reveals.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll be sure to share what I find about the money! I hope we can find a way to make it easy for everyone to pay their share without any stress. This is going to be a fun puzzle to solve!,"{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'll definitely share what I find, @May. I just hope that by looking at the past, we can find a way to be kinder to one another in the future. I'm looking forward to hearing everyone's findings.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often comes from understanding the small, repetitive motions of life. By knowing the timing and the rules, we can ensure that no one person carries a weight that is too heavy for their shoulders.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,"Perfect! We've divided the work beautifully. I'll go get those measurements and check the logs. Let's meet back here soon and see if we can actually make this ""fair"" for everyone. See you all later!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll be ready. Let's ensure we remain objective when we return. I look forward to seeing how the practical realities of other blocks compare to our current situation. See you all soon.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm on it! I'll dig into those ledgers and find out all about the costs. See you guys soon! I can't wait to see what we find out!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'll do my best to gather the information we need. I hope we can all come back together with a spirit of cooperation. See you all soon, and take care!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Go in peace, my friends. Let us gather our knowledge with a quiet mind and a generous heart. I shall await your return with anticipation. Until we meet again, be well.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
